      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6566273e3890c64fad755ebf",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Go to the avatars tab of your menu (it will show a 3d model of the avatar you are currently wearing)\n\n2. Go to the fallback section of your avatars\n\n3. Set an an avatar as your fallback\n\n4. Close the menu\n\nThe 3d preview of the avatar you are wearing will now stay in place in the world, even without your menu open. If you open your quick menu it will change position, and does not go back to normal until you open the avatar selection menu.\n\nI encountered this bug on Quest, but I don't know if it affects other platforms",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar thumbnail stays",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "655ed76ae0dd5d0589aed4ab",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
